01:07:51,428 --> 01:07:57,428
The Faith of Anna Waters is a 2016 American-Singaporean horror film starring American
actors Elizabeth Rice and Matthew Settle and directed by Kelvin Tong.

11
01:14:38,571 --> 01:14:44,571
Billed as Singapore's first Hollywood supernatural feature, the film tells the story of an American journalist who travels to Singapore
to investigate the mysterious suicide of her sister, and delves into one of Tong's favourite horror subgenres: exorcism.

12
01:21:25,714 --> 01:21:31,714
The film was released on 6 May 2016 in the United
States under the title The Offering.

13
01:28:12,857 --> 01:28:18,857
The tone is intense and dark and mind_bending.
